  "about": "Pictures for the books, shown in Augmented Reading's Screens only, taking their turn with the Master Index entries and the screens for the book's era (bibliotheca/neo/app.js, tour). Each is a scene of Kino's stage (kino/lib/stage.js): a map, a timeline or a portrait drawn in SVG and CSS and looping quietly, like a GIF, and still with reduced motion. A picture is either a scene of the Kino film about the book's author (film and scene), or one written here for the book (scene). chapters gives the chapters it goes with, by their numbers in the book's file, from and to; without it, every chapter. Credits: portraits are Kino's (kino/data/media.json: Wikimedia Commons, with author and licence, shown on the picture); maps are world-atlas 2.0.2 (Natural Earth, public domain), drawn with present-day borders for orientation, as Kino's maps are. Checked by tests/bibliotheca-page.test.mjs.",
